{"blocks":[["lathe/","source-block-148","Generates hands-on, multi-part technical tutorials on demand, with LLM skills tuned to make content approachable. Work through the generated tutorials yourself, by hand.",["lathe"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-0","Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3",[]],["Launchpad/","source-block-33","In this Knowledge Garden, Launchpad means the Novation Launchpad Pro Mk3. Other Launchpad models belong under the Novation/Launchpad namespace.",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-186","Key Sub-Namespaces",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-211","Novation Docs",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3","Key Sub-Namespaces"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-237","Launchpad/UG - the launchpad user guide (adapted from the PDF)",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3","Key Sub-Namespaces","Novation Docs"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-309","Launchpad/PRG - the launchpad programmers reference (adapted from PDF)",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3","Key Sub-Namespaces","Novation Docs"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-389","Mental Models",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3","Key Sub-Namespaces"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-411","Launchpad/Q - questions about the Launchpad",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3","Key Sub-Namespaces","Mental Models"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-464","Launchpad/Scale - quick pointers to info about Music Scales",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3","Key Sub-Namespaces","Mental Models"]],["Launchpad/","source-block-537","Launchpad/UI - references to the Launchpad UI",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3","Key Sub-Namespaces","Mental Models"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-20","Launchpad Custom Modes",[]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-47","The Launchpad Pro holds eight Custom Modes, one per slot. Open Launchpad/UI/Mode/4-Custom with the Custom button, then press Track Select button 1 to 8 to choose slot 1 to 8 (Launchpad/UG/08 Custom Modes/02 Default Custom Modes).",["Launchpad Custom Modes"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-384","Each slot starts with a factory layout (Launchpad/UG/11 Appendix/01 Default MIDI Mappings). Sending a mode from Novation/Components to a slot replaces whatever the slot held.",["Launchpad Custom Modes"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-570","Pages in this namespace",["Launchpad Custom Modes"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-600","Launchpad/Custom/Slot — the eight slots on the device. Each Launchpad/Custom/Slot/<N> page points to the mode the slot holds now and keeps its history (Logseq/Entity/Launchpad/Custom/Slot).",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Pages in this namespace"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-806","Launchpad/Custom/Available/<Name> — the named modes saved in Components, whether a slot holds them or not (Logseq/Entity/Launchpad/Custom/Mode).",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Pages in this namespace"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-963","Sending a mode to a slot adds a History entry to the slot's page and points the slot at the mode. No page is renamed.",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Pages in this namespace"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-1085","Launchpad/Custom/Pad/Mode is the Components setting for how a pad behaves when pressed and released.",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Pages in this namespace"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-1194","Available in Components",["Launchpad Custom Modes"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-1224","Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Available in Components"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-1274","Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Arrangement",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Available in Components"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-1323","Launchpad/Custom/Available/2-MF-Presets",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Available in Components"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-1371","Launchpad/Custom/Available/3-MF-Number-Pad",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Available in Components"]],["Launchpad/Custom/","source-block-1422","71-78VertFadeCh2, eight vertical faders, held by Launchpad/Custom/Slot/3 until 2026-11-26 Thu. No page yet.",["Launchpad Custom Modes","Available in Components"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-160","1 Ableton Ctrl",[]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-179","Launchpad Custom Mode for controlling Ableton/Live's transport, Arrangement Record and locators from the top of the grid, with one fader below them.",["1 Ableton Ctrl"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-339","Every control sends a MIDI CC on channel 16. Grid rows 3 to 8, three pads in row 1 and all edge buttons have nothing assigned.",["1 Ableton Ctrl"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-469","Pads",["1 Ableton Ctrl"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-480","Row 1, column 2 (purple)",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-509","Message: CC 114, channel 16. Moved from CC 116 on 2026-11-19 Thu, which it shared with the Set Locator pad.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 2 (purple)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-630","Behavior: Launchpad/Custom/Pad/Mode Momentary; on value 127, off value 0.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 2 (purple)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-717","Controls: Ableton/Live/UI/Control-Bar/Button/Stop.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 2 (purple)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-781","Row 1, column 3 (magenta)",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-811","Message: CC 119, channel 16.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 3 (magenta)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-849","Behavior: Toggle; on value 127, off value 0.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 3 (magenta)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-903","Controls: Ableton/Live/UI/Control-Bar/Button/Arrangement-Record (Global Record in Live's MIDI Mappings list).",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 3 (magenta)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1026","Row 1, column 6 (cyan)",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1053","Message: CC 117, channel 16.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 6 (cyan)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1091","Behavior: Trigger; value 127.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 6 (cyan)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1130","Controls: Previous Locator.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 6 (cyan)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1167","Row 1, column 7 (yellow)",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1196","Message: CC 116, channel 16.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 7 (yellow)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1234","Behavior: Trigger; value 127.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 7 (yellow)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1273","Controls: Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement-View/Button/Set-Locator (Add Locator in Live's MIDI Mappings list).",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 7 (yellow)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1392","Row 1, column 8 (blue)",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1419","Message: CC 118, channel 16.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 8 (blue)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1457","Behavior: Trigger; value 127.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 8 (blue)"]],["Launchpad/Custom/Available/1-Ableton-Ctrl/","source-block-1496","Controls: Next Locator.",["1 Ableton Ctrl","Pads","Row 1, column 8 (blue)"]]],"format_version":5}